# Firmware never goes into this repository, in any form: not the original file, not a built one, not an update
# package, not a copy of a unit's storage. The check before a commit refuses them too (docs/checking.md).
*.ldr
*.tfw
/firmware/
/stock/

# What a build makes, and what it needs from elsewhere (docs/build.md).
/build/
/out/
/out-*/
/open-xy/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# No feature is kept in this repository (README.md). A build writes base.pack and the examples into out/. The one pack
# file kept here is base.pack beside the install page, which puts it on every unit it installs; the build holds it to
# packs/built.json.
*.pack
!/builder/base.pack

# A listing of your own unit's disk, made for the placement step, and the files the installer hands you. The listing
# of packs' files of that name, catalog/listing.json and a pack's catalog/packs/listing.json, are kept.
listing.json
!/catalog/**/listing.json
/downloads/

# The listing of packs beside the install page: the pages workflow joins the files of catalog/ into it when it
# publishes, and a copy made to serve the page on your own computer would go stale (builder/README.md).
/builder/packs.json
